{"title":"Singapore fact of the day","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/925908485/0/marginalrevolution~Singapore-fact-of-the-day.html","date":1759852892000,"content":"<blockquote><p>For every Singaporean who has left Christianity, about three others have become Christians.</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>About 3.2 in fact, if you look at the exact numbers.  Buddhism in Japan and South Korea is being depopulated, also.  Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.pewresearch.org/religion/2025/03/26/around-the-world-many-people-are-leaving-their-childhood-religions/\" target=\"_blank\">the Pew piece</a> on defections from religions.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/10/singapore-fact-of-the-day-4.html\">Singapore fact of the day</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/925908485/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/925908485/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/925908485/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/925908485/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/925908485/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/925908485/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/10/singapore-fact-of-the-day-4.html#co